  "description": "QESCOJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H168 Cd2 Ce4 O24 Sr2. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Cd1 (Cd) has 4 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Cd2 (Cd) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.354-3.579 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.42-101.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H168Cd2Ce4Sr2O24.",
